{"data":{"id":"d3XdeNta2HM","slug":"robert-glasper-experiment","title":"Robert Glasper Experiment","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"XzlqRDvqFnI","slug":"let-it-ride-feat-norah-jones","title":"Let It Ride (feat. Norah Jones)"},{"id":"3MwKx1Dpubc","slug":"smells-like-teen-spirit","title":"Smells Like Teen Spirit"},{"id":"7cHMo0jDW9M","slug":"dillalude-2","title":"Dillalude #2"},{"id":"14sHNyDlmNg","slug":"j-dillalude","title":"J Dillalude"},{"id":"AFeR2v1w_MM","slug":"for-you","title":"For You"}]},"markers":[{"id":"YvbQ0lH9GVU","position":27,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Robert Glasper Experiment - Let It Ride (feat. Norah Jones)","track":{"id":"XzlqRDvqFnI","path":"/artists/robert-glasper-experiment/tracks/let-it-ride-feat-norah-jones/","slug":"let-it-ride-feat-norah-jones","title":"Let It Ride (feat. Norah Jones)","artist":{"slug":"robert-glasper-experiment","title":"Robert Glasper Experiment"},"artwork":"images/artists/robert-glasper-experiment/tracks/let-it-ride-feat-norah-jones.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"p1pSbRuL7vA","slug":"timeless-sounds-10-year-mix","tags":[6,6],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/us/room/1562052422"},"state":"published","title":"Timeless Sounds 10 Year Mix","artwork":"images/episodes/timeless-sounds-10-year-mix/timeless-sounds-10-year-mix.jpg","content":"\n9 mixes from our heavy hitters. \nSounds from all over the world\n\n<!--more-->\n\nAired exclusively on Apple Music.\n\nJump to: \n\n- [Joe Kay](#joe-kay)\n- [Shaka Lion](#shaka-lion)\n- [JAEL](#jael)\n- [Andre Power](#andre-power)\n- [KRONIKA](#kronika)\n- [ESTA.](#esta)\n- [Sasha Marie](#sasha-marie)\n- [IAMNOBODI](#iamnobodi)\n- [Jared Jackson](#jared-jackson)","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":0,"location":"UN","published_at":"2021-04-10T16:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Andre Power","position":3}},{"id":"a1RyQMNONfY","position":52,"timestamp":"01:58:51","rawTrack":"Robert Glasper Experiment - For You","track":{"id":"AFeR2v1w_MM","path":"/artists/robert-glasper-experiment/tracks/for-you/","slug":"for-you","title":"For You","artist":{"slug":"robert-glasper-experiment","title":"Robert Glasper Experiment"},"artwork":"images/artists/robert-glasper-experiment/tracks/for-you.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"9MtqvaStm34","slug":"547","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-547/ra.1619426080","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-547"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #547","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-547.jpg","content":"A fusion of dub, R&B edits, nostalgic tunes, and new music.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2022-04-30T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"pHcfzQb1NIs","position":0,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Robert Glasper Experiment - Smells Like Teen Spirit","track":{"id":"3MwKx1Dpubc","path":"/artists/robert-glasper-experiment/tracks/smells-like-teen-spirit/","slug":"smells-like-teen-spirit","title":"Smells Like Teen Spirit","artist":{"slug":"robert-glasper-experiment","title":"Robert Glasper Experiment"},"artwork":"images/artists/robert-glasper-experiment/tracks/smells-like-teen-spirit.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"A-2xaCFrXnk","slug":"150","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-150-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #150 w/ SOSUPERSAM","artwork":"/images/episodes/150.jpg","content":"Talented & vibrant woman SOSUPERSAM finally came through the studio. \n\n<!--more-->\nIt's been a long time coming and we're happy that you finally get a feel for who she is musically and as a person. Wasn't quite sure what she was gonna play for us, but she showed a great diversity and really brought us back to a place that was very much needed towards the end of her set. She's even cooler as a person. Being humble and driven will always get you far. Joe Kay really brought out a diverse selection of music. \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10814,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-02T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"SOSUPERSAM's Set","position":1}},{"id":"ERWbWGXya6I","position":23,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Robert Glasper Experiment - For You","track":{"id":"AFeR2v1w_MM","path":"/artists/robert-glasper-experiment/tracks/for-you/","slug":"for-you","title":"For You","artist":{"slug":"robert-glasper-experiment","title":"Robert Glasper Experiment"},"artwork":"images/artists/robert-glasper-experiment/tracks/for-you.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"HYh1pKyFzn0","slug":"191","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-191-w-mr-carmack"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #191 w/ Mr. Carmack","artwork":"/images/episodes/191.jpg","content":"It's been long over due but we were finally able to get Carmack one on one. \n<!--more-->\n\nHe is definitely one of the most forward thinking artists of the new generation. If you produce then there is a good chance that you know who Carmack is. He has inspired many all over the world and has pretty much created his own genre of sound. How many times have you heard another producer make a beat similar to his and say to yourself, \"CARMACK\"!?\n\nThis guy has been a big part of Soulection's growth and history and it felt good to finally sit down with my bro to talk about his growth and current inspirations. We talked about how his move to L.A. changed his life, how he feels about other producers who create music that sounds like his, his relationship with drugs and why he calls his music drugs, when we can expect the next album, and much more.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10740,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-11-01T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kays's Session","position":1}},{"id":"C6eTYGQdyxA","position":23,"timestamp":"00:56:29","rawTrack":"Robert Glasper Experiment - Dillalude #2","track":{"id":"7cHMo0jDW9M","path":"/artists/robert-glasper-experiment/tracks/dillalude-2/","slug":"dillalude-2","title":"Dillalude #2","artist":{"slug":"robert-glasper-experiment","title":"Robert Glasper Experiment"},"artwork":"images/artists/robert-glasper-experiment/tracks/dillalude-2.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"U1yV8BHO-5o","slug":"216","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/station/episode-216/ra.1080843652","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-216"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #216","artwork":"/images/episodes/216.jpg","content":"Settle in for an eclectic mix of soul.\n\n\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7249,"location":"US","published_at":"2015-07-11T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"1054oYGcva4","position":27,"timestamp":"01:08:23","rawTrack":"Robert Glasper Experiment - For You","track":{"id":"AFeR2v1w_MM","path":"/artists/robert-glasper-experiment/tracks/for-you/","slug":"for-you","title":"For You","artist":{"slug":"robert-glasper-experiment","title":"Robert Glasper Experiment"},"artwork":"images/artists/robert-glasper-experiment/tracks/for-you.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"U1yV8BHO-5o","slug":"216","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/station/episode-216/ra.1080843652","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-216"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #216","artwork":"/images/episodes/216.jpg","content":"Settle in for an eclectic mix of soul.\n\n\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7249,"location":"US","published_at":"2015-07-11T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"K0frnoI52ek","position":1,"timestamp":"00:03:19","rawTrack":"Robert Glasper Experiment - Dillal